            <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl leading-8 text-lg muted">CommsHQ brings email, SMS, publishing, automation, and commerce signals into one thoughtful workspace. Create less noise. Build more momentum.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row mt-9">
              <a href="/register" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 min-h-12 font-semibold text-base text-white bg-coral rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">Build your first audience</a>
              <a href="#platform" class="inline-flex gap-2 items-center justify-center px-6 min-h-12 font-semibold text-base border border-tone rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 ink panel">
                See the platform
                <span class="h-5 w-5 i-hugeicons-arrow-down-02" aria-hidden="true"></span>
